              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 16.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.19.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ore te nelotu Enkerai e Tung'ani te nkitoo enye, eboitare ilmalaika pookin, neton ina kata to lorika lenye le nkitoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrurrukino loreren pooki dukuya ninye negel ninche anaa olchekut ogelu nkerra arishie nkineji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik nkerra enkaina enye e tatene, nepik inkineji ene kedianye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kejoki ina kata olaiguanani lelo ootii enkaina enye e tatene, ‘Wootu intae ilootamayiana Papa lai, entujung enkitoria naitobirakaki apa intae apa ebaiki enkiterunoto e nkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu aata apa esumash nikinchosho endaa; naata enkure nikinchosho enaok; nara omoni nikirikiriki ang; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nemaishopo nikinchopishopo; namuei nikirumurumu, naena nikibaikiki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amaa ina kata ltung'ana le Nkai aajoki, ‘Lo kitok, kanu kitaduaa iyie iata esumash nikintoti iyie? Aashu iata enkure nikintook iyie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana kanu kitaduaa iyie ira omoni nikirik iyie ang? Anaa minchopo nikinchop iyie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana kanu kitaduaa iyie imuei anaa iena nikibaiki iyie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keng'amaa olaiguanani ajoki, Esipa, ajoki intae, ore anaa enintaasa lelo alashera laainei ooti, nanu intaasa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yesu ina kata ajoki ilootii enkaina enye e kedienye, ‘Enyeito intae entung'uayioki iloodiaa, enchom enkima oo ntarasi naitobirakaki shetani o lmalaika lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu aata apa esumash neitu kintotiti; naata enkure neitu kinchosho enaok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nara omoni neitu kirikiriki ang; nemaishopo neitu kinchopishopo; namuei, naena neitu kibaikiki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neng'amaa sii ninche aajoki, ‘Kanu kitaduaa iyie iata esumash, anaa enkure, anaa ira omoni, anaa minchopo, anaa imuei anaa iena neitu kisiai iyie?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keng'amaa ajoki, ‘Esipa ajoki intae, ore anaa eneitu intaasiasa obo le kulo ooti, nanu eitu intaasiasa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.12.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 12.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa kepuo ninche enkitamioto oo ntarasi; nejing iltung'ana le Nkai enkishui nemeish.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
